# m0agent:note: FFmpeg Weekly Pulse background scatter (the dark/green rectangle field behind every beat, full-bleed). Geometry-only silhouette: 63 rects on a 14x9 coarse grid, each rect inset inside its grid cell (seed 20, density 0.5). Color (mostly dark, ~12% green) is a code-level knob tuned after the pattern is right. NOTE: this currently packs into 5 overlay layers (should be 1 since rects are non-overlapping) - a generator bug I will fix so the scatter costs 1 layer of the chrome's overlay budget.
